@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 215
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
hide circle
hide empty members
package "病历正文与签后补充" as R {
' @reference visit
class "就诊" as visit_r <<entity>>
class "病历" as clinical_record <<entity>> {
 主诉、诊断、处理意见
 草稿／已签署、正文版本
 签署牙医、时间、冻结摘要
 --
 +核对草稿可修改性()
 +更新草稿(当前版本)
 +核对签署完整性(所见与复核)
 +签署并冻结正文()
 +建立当次草稿()
 +核对病历患者及就诊归属()
}
class "检查所见" as clinical_finding <<entity>> {
 牙位、牙面、所见内容
 顺序、记录牙医
 --
 +核对牙位牙面()
 +更新所见(原病历状态)
}
class "病历补充" as record_addendum <<entity>> {
 补充正文、原因
 签署牙医、补充时间
 --
 +核对原病历已签署()
 +签署补充并保留原文()
}
visit_r "1" -- "1" clinical_record
clinical_record "1" *-- "0..*" clinical_finding
clinical_record "1" *-- "0..*" record_addendum
clinical_finding -[hidden]right- record_addendum
note bottom of clinical_record
签署前核对所见和本次健康复核。
签后仅追加独立补充，不改正文或所见；
签署不代替实际结束、资源恢复或收费。
end note
}
@enduml
